Every trade must generate:

### On Entry

```
[TRADE OPEN]
ID=123
Style=ITC
Dir=CALL
Entry=25640
SL=25590
TGT=25740
Conf=0.81
Regime=ROTATION
Reason="ITC aligns with neutral bias"
```

### On Exit

```
