BarsHeld=4
PnL=+70pts (+₹3500)
MFE=+82
MAE=-12
```

### On EOD

```
[EOD SUMMARY]
Trades=3
Wins=2 Losses=1
PnL=+₹4200
BestStyle=REMR
WorstStyle=ITC
DD=-₹800
```

If your logs don’t look like this → you are blind.

