This trade & ledger layer is not “another module”.

It is the **spine of the entire system**.

Everything else is just senses.


Metrics addition: 

FINAL EXECUTABLE PLAN — v2.8 Trade Engine Integration
Objective

Integrate the new trade/ subsystem as the sole authority for position state, exits, and performance metrics, while preserving all existing entry logic.

After this step:

Every trade that enters must flow through:

Brain → Research Engine → Executor → Trade Engine → Exit Engine → Ledger → Reporter

No bypasses. No duplicates. No shadow state.

PHASE 1 — Kill All Legacy Trade State (Hard Requirement)
Files to Audit and Remove Trade State From

Antigravity must search and remove:

File	What must be deleted
hot_path/executor.py	Any open_position, current_trade, trade_ledger
engine/modes/backtest.py	Any _sync_trades_to_db()
engine/modes/live.py	Any trade persistence
workers/oms.py	Any position tracking
brokers/*	Any PnL computation
Invariant

After this phase:

There exists exactly ONE source of truth for trades:

trade/store.py + trade/ledger.py

If any other file stores PnL → FAIL.

PHASE 2 — Entry Wiring (Critical)
Where Entries Must Occur

Only this function may open trades:

trade/lifecycle.py → open_trade()

Executor Contract

File: executor/execute.py

Must do:

from trade.lifecycle import propose_trade, open_trade

if final_action in ["BUY_CALL", "BUY_PUT"]:
    proposal = propose_trade(
        style=selected_style,
        direction=action,
        entry_price=price,
        sl_points=sl,
        target_points=tgt,
        confidence=final_conf,
        metadata=full_context
    )
    open_trade(proposal)

Forbidden

Executor must NOT:

calculate PnL

track open trades

manage exits

write to DB

Executor only proposes.

PHASE 3 — Exit Wiring (Mandatory Loop)
Exit must be checked on EVERY candle

File: engine/modes/backtest.py

Inside main loop:

from trade.exit_engine import check_exits

for candle in day:
    decision = research_engine.step(candle)
    executor.execute(decision)
    check_exits(candle)

Exit engine must:

evaluate SL / TGT / TIME

close trade via lifecycle.close_trade()

update ledger metrics

persist ExitEvent

If exits are not called every candle → system is fake.

PHASE 4 — EOD Enforcement

At exactly 15:30:

from trade.eod import end_of_day

end_of_day(current_day)


This must:

force close open trades

compute DailySummary

persist day metrics

No trade may survive past day boundary.

PHASE 5 — Reporting Authority

Only one place generates metrics:

trade/reporter.py → generate_session_report()


At end of backtest:

report = generate_session_report()
print(report)


No other metrics anywhere else are valid.

